Original AI-assisted OpenSCAD implementation prepared on 2026-10-11.
It uses the ordinary equal-spacing formula and is a separate implementation
from the existing Sewlore FreeCAD Button Spacing Template. No source code,
mesh or image from the older CC BY 4.0 sliding rail was copied.

The MIT license applies to this package's source, generated STL, documentation
and native render images. Keep the copyright and license notice with copies.

OpenSCAD 2021.01 and trimesh 5.1.1 were used as build/verification tools only.
Their executables, libraries and trademarks are not included in the public
source ZIP and are not relicensed here.

Digital CAD checks do not establish physical printing, marker fit, material
